WEBVTT

00:01.847 --> 00:03.933
My mind control doesn't work...

00:04.516 --> 00:06.368
No, I'm sure that's not the case.

00:06.368 --> 00:09.788
Sacrifices! Not enough sacrifices!
I'm sure that's the case!

00:13.983 --> 00:14.984
Hey!

00:15.235 --> 00:16.577
What's going on?

00:16.578 --> 00:18.404
Aren't you supposed to be
controlling the demon sword?

00:18.769 --> 00:21.605
Why do you think I've been
working with you all this time?!

00:21.866 --> 00:22.617
Do something alrea...

00:25.203 --> 00:26.679
More.

00:26.679 --> 00:28.456
I need more sacrifices!

00:28.748 --> 00:30.291
Many more!

00:32.585 --> 00:34.758
The demon sword will not harm me.

00:34.758 --> 00:36.856
I can try as many methods as I want.

00:37.298 --> 00:40.093
I'll bring more sacrifices,
and it'll go back to me!

02:11.006 --> 02:15.594
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Epilogue)

02:16.563 --> 02:17.529
Ashgan...

02:18.456 --> 02:19.649
You're awake.

02:20.875 --> 02:21.902
The seal...

02:22.736 --> 02:23.862
Has it been broken?

02:24.613 --> 02:25.530
Yeah.

02:26.089 --> 02:27.491
It's all over now.

02:28.325 --> 02:30.368
Nothing can stop Ashgan.

02:31.328 --> 02:34.122
Hurry... leave me and run.

02:34.831 --> 02:36.541
You shouldn't be around me.

02:37.897 --> 02:42.412
He must hate my clan so much.

02:44.594 --> 02:45.616
In the end,

02:45.617 --> 02:49.324
I guess I'll end up dead without
even fulfilling my duty.

02:51.852 --> 02:52.869
I'm pissed.

02:53.437 --> 02:56.039
At least... at least...

02:56.940 --> 02:59.568
I wanted to at least
know what a kiss feels like!

03:02.255 --> 03:03.864
You haven't had one?

03:04.281 --> 03:05.966
No, I haven't! Got a problem with that?!

03:06.074 --> 03:08.744
Hey, treat my legs, too.

03:09.036 --> 03:10.662
I can't even walk straight.

03:11.121 --> 03:11.913
Guideau.

03:12.456 --> 03:14.933
Seems like all the cards
are on the table now.

03:16.891 --> 03:19.587
We thought it was just
the Paladin Corps at first,

03:19.963 --> 03:22.298
but now there's also a great elemental,
and an Executioner...

03:22.757 --> 03:25.360
...and an unsealed demon sword, as well.

03:26.263 --> 03:29.058
Good grief.
They're all on the table, all right.

03:30.309 --> 03:31.410
Now, then.

03:31.410 --> 03:33.090
Should we also use it?

03:33.547 --> 03:34.589
Our trump card.

03:38.291 --> 03:39.041
Helga.

03:40.037 --> 03:45.767
That wish of yours...
will you let us fulfill it?

03:46.529 --> 03:47.530
Huh?

03:47.530 --> 03:49.281
Huh? What?!

03:50.116 --> 03:52.259
Now, close your eyes...

03:53.009 --> 03:54.985
Eek! Wait a minute! Wait just a minute!

03:54.985 --> 03:58.056
You can't! I mean, you can, but...

03:58.056 --> 04:01.408
Wait... You'll fulfill my wish,
so that means...

04:01.408 --> 04:02.768
You can't mean... for real?!

04:03.544 --> 04:05.187
Yes, of course.

04:06.021 --> 04:07.606
That's exactly what I mean.

04:10.792 --> 04:12.652
The taste of blood seeping in my mouth...

04:13.170 --> 04:16.822
Perhaps that's not how
first kisses usually feel like.

04:26.375 --> 04:28.293
But a guy's lips...

04:29.044 --> 04:30.754
...sure are soft.

05:16.675 --> 05:18.285
Huh? What?

05:31.773 --> 05:34.276
What is... this chilling feeling?

05:36.528 --> 05:38.905
Even the demon sword has stopped moving.

05:41.158 --> 05:42.367
What in the world...

05:43.827 --> 05:46.054
...is behind this wall?

06:17.027 --> 06:17.944
What?

06:23.325 --> 06:25.994
Where did that thing come from?

06:27.254 --> 06:28.038
Guideau.

06:30.665 --> 06:33.293
The demon sword prefers living sacrifices.

06:33.627 --> 06:35.003
Don't use your right hand.

06:35.420 --> 06:37.272
Are you planning on fighting it?!

06:37.272 --> 06:40.425
Of course. Someone has to stop it.

06:40.734 --> 06:45.055
That's impossible! Why do you think
the Dauntless Witch has been sealing it?!

06:45.305 --> 06:48.725
That it can destroy the world
is not an exaggeration!

06:48.975 --> 06:52.120
If it wants to, it can cut through
everything that exists in this world!

06:52.270 --> 06:55.690
The demon sword Ashgan is able to
tear through creation itself!

06:56.233 --> 06:58.360
Yeah. I know that.

06:59.361 --> 07:01.238
A demon sword's power is tremendous.

07:01.713 --> 07:03.632
I don't doubt that in the slightest.

07:04.574 --> 07:05.492
However...

07:07.427 --> 07:08.845
You're a bit mistaken.

07:17.003 --> 07:19.003
It's not the only one.

07:19.631 --> 07:21.925
The power to destroy the world...

07:22.342 --> 07:24.235
There are countless
of those things out there,

07:24.719 --> 07:26.571
in this world.

07:30.934 --> 07:32.602
It's afraid of it...

07:33.353 --> 07:37.065
The Great Elemental is more afraid
of this man than the demon sword!

08:22.969 --> 08:24.087
The demon sword...

08:25.405 --> 08:27.240
You probably feel the same, right?

08:28.759 --> 08:30.427
Just like the Great Elemental,

08:30.744 --> 08:33.746
this man and the mystery around him...

08:34.748 --> 08:36.332
...must be giving you fear!

09:05.236 --> 09:06.463
Now's our window to defeat it!

09:50.782 --> 09:52.659
It's producing even more power.

09:53.201 --> 09:54.244
It can't be...

09:54.703 --> 09:56.329
No, I see!

09:57.163 --> 10:00.683
The demon sword was finally released
from its seal after hundreds of years.

10:01.084 --> 10:02.794
Of course it would've been dull at first.

10:03.336 --> 10:06.297
It's only now reaching its true form!

10:10.944 --> 10:13.346
So you mean it's hella strong?

10:14.055 --> 10:15.515
That's right.

10:15.890 --> 10:17.058
Stronger than me?

10:18.017 --> 10:19.102
I wonder about that.

10:22.998 --> 10:26.459
But which one's stronger,
you or a demon sword...

10:26.985 --> 10:28.361
That intrigues me.

11:02.771 --> 11:04.022
Don't worry.

11:04.856 --> 11:06.775
I'm not going to use my right hand.

11:07.901 --> 11:08.651
Now...

11:09.569 --> 11:12.155
Brace yourself!

11:31.883 --> 11:32.842
Ashgan.

11:34.469 --> 11:36.429
I'm going to seal you now.

11:40.308 --> 11:41.684
You...

11:45.146 --> 11:46.648
You'll remain conscious,

11:47.106 --> 11:48.942
but you'll never be able to move again,

11:49.526 --> 11:51.361
neither will you be able to sleep.

11:52.070 --> 11:54.088
You'll live, but forever be imprisoned,

11:54.572 --> 11:55.448
Ashgan.

11:56.115 --> 11:59.010
Did you trick me... Quena?

11:59.702 --> 12:01.788
Yes. I tricked you.

12:02.914 --> 12:04.999
You've killed too many people.

12:06.084 --> 12:08.795
I can't allow that any longer.

12:10.547 --> 12:12.966
I'd love to just give you instant death,

12:14.092 --> 12:15.969
but that's not what everyone else wants.

12:18.179 --> 12:19.597
I want to let you die,

12:20.181 --> 12:22.016
but I also want you to suffer.

12:23.893 --> 12:25.122
Inside me,

12:25.520 --> 12:29.065
I feel hatred towards you,
but also one other feeling...

12:31.901 --> 12:32.944
At least,

12:33.736 --> 12:35.655
I hope only the part of me
that is not hatred...

12:36.823 --> 12:39.868
...will be inherited by my children.

12:48.918 --> 12:50.795
What a surprise.

12:51.713 --> 12:54.465
The city is still largely intact.

12:56.301 --> 13:01.097
To think that there exists a being
who can stop me so quickly..

13:02.140 --> 13:03.433
But...

13:04.142 --> 13:05.643
Thanks to you,

13:06.102 --> 13:07.937
I didn't have to kill her.

13:09.414 --> 13:12.150
Even though I brought you so much danger,

13:12.734 --> 13:16.362
you never even wanted to
unsheathe me until the very end.

13:17.280 --> 13:20.325
I couldn't... have my way.

13:21.868 --> 13:22.952
Helga.

13:23.453 --> 13:27.874
You really are a... stubborn girl.

13:43.949 --> 13:45.825
(Ashgan.)

13:50.772 --> 13:52.106
It's the end of the world!

13:52.106 --> 13:53.858
Calm down. Please, calm down!

13:54.168 --> 13:56.002
You sure this place is safe?

13:56.002 --> 13:58.671
Yes. We're protected by a barrier here.

13:58.671 --> 13:59.781
You don't have to worry.

14:00.531 --> 14:02.408
The sky breaking apart,
the ground shaking...

14:02.951 --> 14:04.327
The town is a mess.

14:04.744 --> 14:06.454
What in the world is happening?

14:06.746 --> 14:08.665
There has been no contact
from the base, too...

14:09.540 --> 14:10.667
Hey, look!

14:14.003 --> 14:15.480
Help me...

14:15.480 --> 14:17.315
Let me in!

14:21.803 --> 14:23.680
Guideau, he's right ahead.

14:37.402 --> 14:39.654
Oop. He's started running.

14:40.154 --> 14:42.740
One millimeter to the right,
and three down.

14:43.324 --> 14:45.743
You think I can aim that precisely?

14:46.160 --> 14:49.931
I guess you're not as dexterous
in this body compared to that one.

14:51.624 --> 14:55.586
Then, you can just hope he doesn't die...

14:56.087 --> 14:57.755
...and try your best.

15:12.270 --> 15:14.605
S... Stop...

15:16.208 --> 15:18.109
P-Please...

15:18.109 --> 15:21.504
S-Stop... it...

15:26.200 --> 15:27.827
Tell me, Executioner.

15:28.286 --> 15:31.164
Why did you feel the need to attack us?

15:31.748 --> 15:35.126
If the order given to you was
to retrieve the demon sword,

15:35.501 --> 15:39.213
You could've done it easily
without this much sacrifice.

15:40.214 --> 15:41.858
It wasn't a mission.

15:41.858 --> 15:44.510
It was my personal goal.

15:44.969 --> 15:47.388
Matt Cugat wouldn't cooperate,

15:47.388 --> 15:51.267
and because of the Elemental's protection,
I wasn't sure if I could brainwash him.

15:52.268 --> 15:54.896
The only thing I can do is steal it.

15:55.938 --> 15:57.565
I wanted the demon sword.

15:58.191 --> 16:00.877
I've dedicated years of my life
towards that goal.

16:01.569 --> 16:05.490
But I'm not the only one
who wants its power.

16:06.115 --> 16:09.385
All the other Executioners,
the Holy Church...

16:09.385 --> 16:11.329
They all want the demon sword!

16:12.038 --> 16:14.765
If Cugat gets his hands
on the demon sword,

16:14.765 --> 16:18.419
I'll never get the chance to get it again!

16:19.003 --> 16:20.213
So...

16:20.213 --> 16:21.589
I see.

16:21.891 --> 16:24.967
It's true that Executioners
usually work in pairs.

16:25.510 --> 16:29.305
Considering the other one never showed up,
I don't think he's lying.

16:29.847 --> 16:32.642
And seems like this is
all he would tell us.

16:33.101 --> 16:36.938
Executioners are silenced
using a contract spell.

16:37.480 --> 16:39.440
Don't hope to get any more information.

16:39.857 --> 16:42.401
The only way left to make use of him...

16:42.735 --> 16:46.989
...is make him take responsibility for
causing this tremendous damage.

16:47.365 --> 16:49.365
However, Executioners live in the shadows.

16:49.700 --> 16:51.953
They're humans who don't exist.

16:52.286 --> 16:55.373
All you can do is say
that they're the true culprit.

16:56.457 --> 17:00.878
Oh, but they don't have to stay alive.

17:01.212 --> 17:03.422
It was a magic battle of great magnitude.

17:03.923 --> 17:06.634
Wouldn't be odd to say
they were slashed to pieces.

17:06.634 --> 17:08.903
N-No... Wait!

17:09.095 --> 17:12.198
Please, wait! You're mistaken, Colonel!

17:12.198 --> 17:14.517
I was just being used, and...

17:16.018 --> 17:18.354
I was naive, I see.

17:18.646 --> 17:20.356
Yeah. You're naive.

17:21.898 --> 17:23.442
I guess that's true.

17:23.859 --> 17:25.361
I am naive.

17:26.213 --> 17:29.699
My kind of justice doesn't
allow any death of the virtuous,

17:30.592 --> 17:35.997
and deaths of wicked people who
might have a shred of good inside them.

17:37.165 --> 17:39.392
So no matter what kind
of person they might be,

17:39.667 --> 17:41.794
I would take them to the brink of death,
but then let them live.

17:42.587 --> 17:43.296
But...

17:45.423 --> 17:48.968
...I don't show any mercy to
those who have crossed that line.

17:50.469 --> 17:53.990
Having said that,
the subordinates I lost were soldiers.

17:54.223 --> 17:55.975
You can say they died in the line of duty.

17:57.643 --> 17:59.979
Your family got taken away from you.

18:01.397 --> 18:02.356
What do you want to do?

18:06.110 --> 18:07.195
Nothing much.

18:07.820 --> 18:09.655
It doesn't bother me so much anymore.

18:10.281 --> 18:11.824
This much is enough.

18:12.783 --> 18:14.327
I don't want to see them in any more.

18:14.827 --> 18:16.704
If you want to do something,
do it somewhere else.

18:17.997 --> 18:18.998
I see.

18:19.707 --> 18:21.375
But I do have one request.

18:22.644 --> 18:26.631
Give them so much pain
that they regret ever being born.

18:29.717 --> 18:31.093
Understood.

18:37.784 --> 18:41.729
He just left without even
questioning you suspicious people...

18:42.230 --> 18:44.415
He must've felt it somewhat.

18:45.066 --> 18:48.694
There's a tacit agreement
between us an the Paladin Corps.

18:49.278 --> 18:52.240
We can't allow sparks
that would lead to war.

18:52.490 --> 18:53.866
So I guess he just left us alone.

18:54.283 --> 18:55.117
Why is that the case?

18:55.534 --> 18:59.163
If an all-out war breaks out,
the world might cease to exist.

19:00.348 --> 19:01.624
You're just joking, right?

19:02.208 --> 19:04.877
Well, whatever. Who cares who you are now.

19:06.087 --> 19:08.297
You'll protect me, right?

19:08.798 --> 19:10.132
Yes, of course.

19:10.424 --> 19:13.761
We'll keep you as safe as it can be.

19:17.139 --> 19:19.850
However, in case you're interested...

19:20.268 --> 19:22.853
I'd like you to lend us your power.

19:23.145 --> 19:24.146
My power?

19:24.647 --> 19:27.275
Do you want a witch's power?

19:28.359 --> 19:29.610
Then, I wouldn't be of help.

19:30.236 --> 19:33.030
A large part of my power
is used for keeping up Ashgan's seal.

19:33.572 --> 19:36.784
Only a minuscule amount
is left for me to actually use...

19:39.412 --> 19:40.413
Right...

19:41.038 --> 19:42.748
I don't need to do it anymore.

19:43.541 --> 19:44.625
The seal.

19:47.169 --> 19:50.464
Guideau hit it with her left hand.

19:52.550 --> 19:56.012
A monster as powerful as a demon sword
would surely have survived that.

19:56.762 --> 19:59.240
Our organization would
probably be able to repair it.

19:59.557 --> 20:03.077
It'll take time, but one day,
I'm sure it will come back to life.

20:04.395 --> 20:07.023
If it dies, it would be
for the sake of the world.

20:07.624 --> 20:10.793
That would probably also be
the best thing for Ashgan, too.

20:11.293 --> 20:12.795
That's what I thought, but...

20:14.488 --> 20:15.614
Ah...

20:16.240 --> 20:17.199
I see.

20:17.742 --> 20:19.076
It's still alive.

20:24.332 --> 20:25.333
Yes...

20:26.000 --> 20:27.518
...this must be a curse.

20:31.756 --> 20:33.983
Hey, so you're Ashgan?

20:34.342 --> 20:38.512
I guess demon swords aren't
as big of a deal as I thought.

20:38.971 --> 20:41.766
- Hey, are you listening? Hello?
- Come to think of it,

20:42.058 --> 20:45.895
I already realized it
as soon as I saw her.

20:48.022 --> 20:50.249
But it didn't sit right with me

20:50.249 --> 20:51.776
and I couldn't accept it.

20:52.360 --> 20:53.878
Helga, you can't.

20:54.111 --> 20:56.906
You have to let the demon sword
rest in slumber underground.

20:58.991 --> 21:00.201
Otherwise, it's dangerous.

21:00.761 --> 21:03.871
I mean... I mean, it's because...

21:04.789 --> 21:06.849
Don't you just feel bad?

21:07.249 --> 21:10.144
It's supposed to a sword that
can bring disaster or whatever,

21:10.144 --> 21:14.423
but it's now in this form,
only able to roll its eye around!

21:14.757 --> 21:17.443
Besides, it can't even
"rest in slumber" in the first place!

21:17.443 --> 21:20.112
It's always just looking,
like a fly on the wall!

21:20.221 --> 21:22.530
Covered in dust! That's just too sad!

21:22.530 --> 21:23.782
Look at it!

21:23.782 --> 21:26.827
This ridge is so dusty!

21:26.827 --> 21:29.872
Fine, fine, I get it. Put it back already.

21:29.872 --> 21:32.541
- Look, there's dust here, too...
- Come on, Helga...

21:32.541 --> 21:37.113
It's more sad that this little girl
is even feeling pity for it.

21:37.405 --> 21:38.531
That's true.

21:40.741 --> 21:42.034
It's laughing...

21:42.326 --> 21:43.244
It is?

21:43.595 --> 21:46.997
Is it so scared that
it can only laugh, or something?

21:47.248 --> 21:49.875
Oh, so angry you just have to laugh?

21:50.251 --> 21:51.894
Come on, say something too!

21:51.894 --> 21:54.563
She's being this much
of a laughingstock...

21:54.797 --> 21:57.633
...but there's not
a trace of anger inside her.

22:02.513 --> 22:04.431
She's the spitting image of Quena...

22:05.391 --> 22:08.352
And that part of her
that is not hatred...

22:09.103 --> 22:11.647
Maybe I have to accept it now...

22:13.667 --> 22:15.943
No, I will never accept her!

22:17.403 --> 22:18.779
This must be a curse.

22:22.158 --> 22:24.869
No doubt, a witch's curse.

24:01.257 --> 24:03.968
Long time no see. I've missed you!

24:05.928 --> 24:08.389
(The Witch of Origin)
Next episode, "The Witch of Origin".
